{"id":"en_queen-of-letting-go","title":"Queen of Letting Go","titleEn":"Queen of Letting Go","description":"June and her parents are killed in a freak accident, and only afterward does she see her family for what they truly are. Given another life alongside them, she abandons everyone else's expectations and concentrates solely on winning over the enemy who grieved for her in her previous life. She pays no attention to business crises, allows her sister to take her fiancé, and even applauds when her grandparents place the family empire in a cousin's hands. The family is thrown into disarray and pleads with her to take charge once more.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/queen-of-letting-go/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/queen-of-letting-go/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Drama","Family Drama","Getting Back at Ex","Self-growth","Sharp-tongued","Reborn"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dladi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_queen-of-letting-go_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dladi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_queen-of-letting-go_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dladi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_queen-of-letting-go_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dladi/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_queen-of-letting-go_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dladi/?pub=4occak","kin